OL,3,AIndia 'cockroach' leaders detained
OL,4,Aafter entering barricaded protest site
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeaders of India's Cockroach Janta
OL,7,FParty (CJP) were detained early on
OL,8,FTuesday after they entered a
OL,9,Fheavily-guarded protest site and
OL,10,Fchanted slogans demanding the country's
OL,11,Felection chief resign over a
OL,12,Fcontroversial revision of electoral
OL,13,Frolls.
OL,15,FParty founder Abhijeet Dipke shared a
OL,16,Fvideo showing Ashutosh Ranka and Saurav
OL,17,FDas being taken away from Jantar Mantar
OL,18,Fin Delhi, a historic observatory
OL,19,Fpopular for protests, by police.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
