OL,3,AIndia 'cockroach' leaders detained
OL,4,Aafter entering barricaded protest site
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootage showed the two - along with
OL,7,Fothers - climbing over police
OL,8,Fbarricades before chanting slogans
OL,9,Fwhile holding the Indian flag.
OL,11,FPrime Minister Narendra Modi's
OL,12,Fopponents allege the voter list
OL,13,Frevision benefits his party, a charge
OL,14,Fit and the Election Commission reject.
